{"unit_id":"yunling-bionic__dsh-rule-guard#card-zh","repo":"yunling-bionic/dsh-rule-guard","commit":"fbf23b93fff72aa12073b56fa57806988cf12080","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rule-guard（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在工具执行前依据项目规则和用户当前目标复核即将发生的动作。它挂载到 Harness 的 tools/pre-execute 钩子，将工具参数、目标上下文和相关路径交给当前会话模型判断；对未知工具、有副作用的动作以及工作区外读取进行复核，并在符合条件时继续执行、偏离目标时返回原因和修正建议。插件还支持读取多处规则文件、只缓存拒绝结果，并提供首次安装横幅和事件日志。适合希望让 DSH 的工具操作贴合当前任务范围、并按项目文件维护规则的用户。无需单独配置 API Key，但复核依赖当前会话模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:445-473","lib/index.js:821-883","lib/index.js:1009-1134","client.js:123-139"]}
{"unit_id":"yunling-bionic__dsh-rule-guard#card-en","repo":"yunling-bionic/dsh-rule-guard","commit":"fbf23b93fff72aa12073b56fa57806988cf12080","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rule-guard reviews DSH tool actions against project rules and the current goal before execution. It sends details to the session model, which can deny out-of-scope actions with a reason and correction. The plugin loads rule files, caches denials, shows a first-run banner, and logs events.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:445-473","lib/index.js:821-883","lib/index.js:1009-1134","client.js:123-139"]}
